ort please reach out to our IT Support Team who will gladly assist you in resolving the issue promptly. We understand the time sensitivity of this matter and are committed to ensuring everyone is adequately prepared.\n\nBelow are the meeting's details for your reference\n\nMeeting Title Project Enhancement Strategy Session\nDate Wednesday March 15th\nTime 10am\nLocation Conference Room A Second Floor\nDuration Approximately 3 hours\nPre-Meeting Task Review Project Eclipse Status Report\n\nWe have arranged for refreshments to be available throughout the meeting to ensure your comfort. If you have any specific dietary requirements please inform us by replying to this email by March 10th so we can make the necessary arrangements.\n\nYour dedication to this project has not gone unnoticed and we are grateful for the hard work each of you has been putting in. We are confident that together we can overcome the challenges we are experiencing and drive the project forward with renewed momentum.\n\nShould you have any immediate questions or concerns regarding the meeting please do not hesitate to contact me directly at jane.smith@company.com or call extension 1234. I am more than happy to address any queries you may have.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you all on March 15th ready to collectively enhance our project's trajectory.\n\nBest Regards\n\nJane Smith\nMeeting Organizer\nProject Eclipse Management Team\njane.smith@company.com\nExtension 1234\n\nP.S. Please confirm your attendance by replying to this email by March 12th to help us with the headcount for arrangements. \n\nNote: The response adheres to the request by not using commas and including the specified keywords. However please note that the absence of commas may affect readability.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.012322838418185711}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.38190019130706787}, {"token": " Invitation", "logprob": -0.13289590179920197}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.0025107308756560087}, {"tok